    "id": "M26",
    "title_zh": "认知发展与取得的组合解释",
    "title_en": "Cognitive development and acquired compositional interpretation",
    "claim_zh": "取得／构造的组合操作进入沟通、分节、绑定与新使用；移动形成访问，保留访问及歧义选择后续经历。公开命名记录现限制自动所指注视的经验对应。错误确信、执行失败与完整目标的未完成范围保留。",
    "claim_en": "Acquired/formed composition enters communication, grouping, binding and new use; movement forms access, and retained access and ambiguity select later encounters. Public naming records now limit automatic target-gaze correspondence. Mistaken confidence, execution failure and the unfinished full objective remain.",
    "scope_zh": "取得25项定理／52项审计；构造37／65；传递27／45；分节23／51；绑定23／41；行动场景16／29；经历选择22／46，最新317项继承审计分列。空间／类别、目录、准则、初次巡查与合作命名仍给定。新复算：36名婴儿1,508次命名，三秒467次记录到其他物体而无所指注视；另45次两者皆零，五秒前类仍393次。它不是学习错误或精确论文复现；无新Lean定理。下一连接是协调线索、经历接纳／加权及保留纠正；完整心理、演化对应及意识未完成。",
    "scope_en": "Acquisition: 25 theorems / 52 audits; formation: 37 / 65; transmission: 27 / 45; grouping: 23 / 51; binding: 23 / 41; enacted scenes: 16 / 29; encounter selection: 22 / 46, with 317 inherited audits separately rebuilt. Spatial/category laws, catalogue, criterion, initial surveys and cooperative naming remain supplied. New reanalysis: 1,508 naming events from 36 infants; at three seconds, 467 show other gaze with zero target, with 45 zero on both; 393 of the former remain at five seconds. This is neither a learning-error measure nor exact paper replication; no new Lean theorem. Next: coordination cues, encounter admission/weighting and retained correction. Full psychology, evolutionary correspondence and consciousness remain incomplete.",
